      "sourceHTML": "<h4 class=\"subsection\"><span>5.9.2 Upper/Lower case conversion</span></h4>"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "GNU ⟦0⟧’s substitute command (⟦1⟧) supports upper/lower case conversions using ⟦2⟧,⟦3⟧ codes. These conversions support multibyte characters:",
      "tokens": {
        "⟦0⟧": "<code class=\"command\">sed</code>",
        "⟦1⟧": "<code class=\"code\">s</code>",
        "⟦2⟧": "<code class=\"code\">\\U</code>",
        "⟦3⟧": "<code class=\"code\">\\L</code>"
      },
      "sourceHTML": "<p>GNU <code class=\"command\">sed</code>’s substitute command (<code class=\"code\">s</code>) supports upper/lower\ncase conversions using <code class=\"code\">\\U</code>,<code class=\"code\">\\L</code> codes.\nThese conversions support multibyte characters:\n</p>"
    },
